# Cursor & AI Assistant Rules for ViDo

Before writing or editing code in this repository:
1. You MUST read AGENTS.md and FOLDER_STRUCTURE.md.
2. Adhere strictly to the modular folder structure:
   - UI primitives in `src/components/ui/` (exported via `index.ts`).
   - Domain features in `src/features/<feature>/`.
   - Data models & pure logic in `src/data/`.
   - Do not create arbitrary root folders or dump files in `src/`.
3. Use CSS custom property variables (`var(--accent)`, `var(--surface)`, `var(--canvas)`, `var(--ink)`, `var(--line)`) with Tailwind CSS v4.
4. Keep the UI presented as a clean SaaS product with an interactive `/preview` demo (not an academic project).
5. Always run `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, and `npm run build` to verify changes before completing tasks.
6. Git push: The agent is authorized to run `git push` autonomously when all verification checks pass and changes are complete and ready to be pushed.
